  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mn>0</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\